  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0c5cbb483bddf4c478998c8960188805, type: 3}
  m_Name: L5_TheShadowTalk_FINAL
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - (He looks up at Minh, a faint, sad smile on his dark face.)
  - I was so scared, Minh...
  - "I thought if we moved on, she\u2019d disappear completely. I thought I was protecting
    her memory by staying here in the dark."
  - "But you\u2019re stronger than me."
  - "You\u2019re willing to carry the weight of her absence into the bright, messy
    world."
  - "I\u2019m scared to go... but I\u2019m so, so tired of being the only thing left
    of us."
  - Go on. Take the last shot.
  - "I\u2019ll be quiet now. I'll just be... a part of the picture."
  - Not the whole thing.
  - Just a part... But
  - I'm happy to be a part of that happy picture.
